1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
The non-human part of you is about to lose all control.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
They suspect it's magic that the humans have discovered

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
a forbidden enchantment that could destroy the world.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
They called it Seraph of the End, I feel.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Snap out of it! Please, you!

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
And so it begins.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
You! Stop it! Please, you have to!

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
For all of us are going to die!

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Come back to us!

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,000
It's been five days. What the hell did you do to him?

11
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,000
What would you do to ensure the future of humanity?

12
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,000
How can we survive in this ruined world?

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
More importantly, how do we completely eradicate the vampires?

14
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
A human victory will require sacrifice.

15
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
As usual, the humans' lust for power is out of control.

16
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,000
And we vampires are so arrogant that we take things too lightly.

17
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Wouldn't you agree with me?

18
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
The End

19
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Lend me your power, Mahiru.

20
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Go ahead and kill me. No one would blame you.

21
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Don't mock me. You could dodge if you wanted.

22
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
I wouldn't mind if you were the one who took my life.

23
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Looking for atonement?

24
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Sorry, but you're going to have to live with your mistakes, sir.

25
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,000
My sister Mahiru loved you, Lieutenant Colonel.

26
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:42,000
But she was possessed by a demon. Passion consumed her.

27
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,000
And then you...

28
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,000
That's right.

29
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,000
I killed your sister.

30
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
But Mahiru didn't leave this world.

31
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,000
She became something else.

32
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:57,000
You used her to create your cursed gear and betray the Hiragi family.

33
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,000
You're possessed by my sister.

34
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Is that why you're trying to manipulate you?

35
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,000
Because my sister is telling you to?

36
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,000
What's your endgame with him?

37
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:16,000
Lieutenant Colonel, if you're going to end up hurting you, even a bit, then I must humbly ask you to stop.

38
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Why? Don't tell me you've fallen for that idiotic kid.

39
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:31,000
It's true that your sister is in here.

40
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,000
But I am the one who's in control.

41
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,000
I'm not possessed by her.

42
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Would you even know if she had you?

43
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,000
I don't care whether you believe me or not.

44
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:17,000
You're always here lately.

45
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,000
What are you reading?

46
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,000
You scared me, Shinoa.

47
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,000
Aren't you still supposed to be on bed rest and recovering?

48
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,000
I was going nuts in that bed.

49
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,000
Besides, I feel totally fine now.

50
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,000
The doctors will decide when you're back in fighting shape.

51
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,000
Besides...

52
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,000
What is it?

53
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,000
Nothing. Forget it.

54
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,000
Wait, you're not really reading this, are you?

55
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,000
I bet you're hiding porn in here.

56
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,000
Hey, give that back.

57
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,000
Come on.

58
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,000
Where'd you hide it?

59
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Jeez.

60
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,000
Tell me.

61
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,000
Do you want to turn Mika back into a human being?

62
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:15,000
If that's the case, I might have some helpful information.

63
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,000
Huh?

64
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,000
Do you want to hear it?

65
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Yeah, I do.

66
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:24,000
Aw, you're always so cute and obedient whenever you want something.

67
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,000
Hey, shut up! Just tell me what you know, okay?

68
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:32,000
First of all, it's pretty rare that a human is turned into a vampire.

69
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:35,000
The bloodsuckers like to keep their ranks tight and their numbers small.

70
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:41,000
More importantly, within vampire society, the nobles are the only ones who have the authority to turn a human.

71
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:45,000
Wait, so it wasn't random that Mika was turned? He was chosen?

72
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,000
Can you think of a noble who might have picked him?

73
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,000
Yeah, maybe.

74
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:56,000
You know, it's our duty to destroy vampires. All of them.

75
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,000
Not him.

76
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,000
I thought Mika was dead.

77
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,000
But he's alive and that's enough.

78
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,000
Tell me, Shinoa.

79
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:08,000
Do you have any idea how to turn a vampire back into a human?

80
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,000
I see.

81
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,000
Well, now what?

82
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:18,000
I don't think that I've ever seen you look so serious before you.

83
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:22,000
It's almost like you found a whole new reason to live.

84
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:28,000
Special Private Yuichiro Hyakuya. Report to the First Office immediately.

85
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,000
I wonder what Gurren wants now.

86
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:35,000
No. It's probably the Hiiragi family who summoned you.

87
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:42,000
Hold on, the Hiiragi family? You mean the leaders of the demon company that got Japan back on its feet after the world went to crap?

88
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:45,000
You really shouldn't keep them waiting.

89
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:58,000
Wait a minute. Isn't your last name, Hiiragi?

90
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:04,000
Ah, you've finally figured out my secrets. I'm not just a sergeant. I'm basically royalty.

91
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,000
Now, feel free to worship me as much as you'd like.

92
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:17,000
Okay, okay, all joking aside, the Hiiragis can be an extremely intense group of people. So be careful, okay, Yu?

93
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,000
Do you?

94
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,000
There's my favorite moron.

95
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:31,000
So the most powerful family in Japan pages you and you come running like a dog.

96
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:34,000
What? Am I just supposed to ignore them then?

97
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:37,000
I've got a little story for you.

98
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:41,000
Once upon a time, a wise old man freed a doomed crane from a hunter's trap.

99
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:46,000
In return, the crane wove a beautiful cloth from its own wings as a gift for the man.

100
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,000
Huh? What are you talking about?

101
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:52,000
I am the wise man who saved you, remember?

102
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:57,000
And I was nice enough to teach you how to survive in this world and protect your family.

103
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:01,000
What's gotten into you? And why do I feel like you're patronizing me?

104
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:04,000
In a manner of speaking, you can return the favor today.

105
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,000
Will you just tell me what it is you want me-

106
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:10,000
I saved your life and now I own you. So don't go wagging your tail for them.

107
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:16,000
So that's what this is about. You don't control me.

108
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,000
You're wrong about that, Yu.

109
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:23,000
This is ridiculous. I don't care about whatever grudge you have against the Hiragi family.

110
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,000
It doesn't-

111
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:28,000
Shut up and listen, kid. You may not care about army politics, but that's the way this world works.

112
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,000
You don't have to worry about me, Gurren.

113
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Come on. I'm not someone who abandons his friends. Haven't you learned that about me yet?

114
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:45,000
Yeah, I guess. But that doesn't make me feel any better. After all, I am not your friend.

115
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,000
Oh yeah? Well then what are you?

116
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:54,000
Guardian. You're superior. Lifesaver. I'm basically your god.

117
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:57,000
Ugh. Please.

118
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:04,000
What's up? Did you get called in too?

119
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,000
How did it go?

120
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,000
It was just a stupid interview.

121
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:16,000
Apparently I'm moving up a rank for my part in fighting off the vampires and my bravery on the battlefield.

122
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,000
A promotion, huh? Nice.

123
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,000
It's no surprise. I totally deserve it, don't you think?

124
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,000
If you say so.

125
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:28,000
Hey, wait! You can't just say that and then leave!

126
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:37,000
You know I shouldn't be promoted. I was completely useless when things got tough on the battlefield.

127
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:40,000
Sure, I can talk a big game, but I can't follow through.

128
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:43,000
It's because I'm... I'm so weak.

129
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:50,000
And yet, I bet I'm the only one getting promoted. Just because I'm part of the Sangu family.

130
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:53,000
Go ahead and laugh! Go on!

131
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,000
I'm a failure!

132
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,000
Stop it. I'm not laughing, Mitsuba.

133
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:10,000
It's weird. I mean, you and Shinoa? I had no idea until today that we basically have two princesses on our team.

134
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:14,000
Between the Sangus and the Hiragis, shouldn't we be living in a castle?

135
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:18,000
You are... such an idiot.

136
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,000
Whatever.

137
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:24,000
Anyway, this promotion is good news. The higher you go, the more you can help me out.

138
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,000
You mean, your family, right?

139
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,000
Yeah.

140
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:31,000
They're going to ask about that in the interview.

141
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:35,000
They think you might be a spy, so I've been ordered to keep an eye on you.

142
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,000
Oh? Wow. Do you think that I'm a spy?

143
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:45,000
I told them that was impossible, and that in my opinion, you're not smart enough to be a double agent. So there.

144
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:51,000
Thanks, I guess. But seriously, I'm glad that you believe in me.

145
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,000
Wait, you...

146
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,000
Hmm?

147
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:01,000
The Hiragi family is terrifying. Watch yourself.

148
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,000
I will. Thanks.

149
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:21,000
Was that a sigh? What do you have to be depressed about?

150
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:24,000
Shinoa, what are you doing out here?

151
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,000
Oh, nothing.

152
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,000
Just out enjoying a little walk.

153
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:30,000
Did the Hiragi family talk to you?

154
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:32,000
Yeah, they gave me a promotion.

155
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:34,000
I'm now a special second lieutenant.

156
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,000
Oh.

157
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:41,000
Wow, that's super impressive, Mitsu. And so shocking that a Sangu can get promoted without actually working for it.

158
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,000
Oh, don't be upset.

159
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,000
Oh, yeah?

160
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:51,000
What about you? I bet they were falling all over themselves to move you up a rank and make themselves even more-

161
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:56,000
No promotion here. And besides, if they did try to move me up a rank, I would just kindly refuse.

162
00:10:57,000 --> 00:11:00,000
That sounds about right. The Hiragi's do what they want.

163
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:05,000
Not all of us. Actually, I kinda think my family has lost all hope for me these days.

164
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,000
Sure.

165
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:11,000
So, how much information did you have to give up in exchange for the promotion?

166
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,000
What do you mean?

167
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:17,000
They wanted to know about what happened when you freaked out, right? When he lost control?

168
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:21,000
I told them that I didn't know anything. Seemed like they didn't either.

169
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:27,000
If that's true, then the experimentation on you must not have been officially sanctioned by the Demon Army.

170
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:32,000
Do you have any idea what that was on the battlefield?

171
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,000
I don't. I wish I did.

172
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:39,000
In a world like this, it's not always clear who's on your side and who's not.

173
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:42,000
I just hope you's smart enough to know the difference.

