That was a test of loyalty to make sure you aren't a traitor.

199
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:38,000
Now, shall we go ahead and start your interview?

200
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:41,000
Who the heck are you?

201
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:46,000
Kureto Hiragi, Imperial Demon Army Lieutenant General.

202
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:53,000
Yurichiro Hyakuya, let's get a better sense of how skilled you are with a sword.

203
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:55,000
But don't activate the curse.

204
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,000
Sounds like fun.

205
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:00,000
But don't get angry if I humiliate the almighty Hiragi.

206
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,000
Oh, you.

207
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:06,000
Perhaps it would be better if you don't listen to everything Brother Kureto says.

208
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,000
What?

209
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,000
Ignore him.

210
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:10,000
Possess me, Raimeki.

211
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:24,000
So this is the best you can do?

212
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:26,000
I have to admit I'm not impressed.

213
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:29,000
That was dirty.

214
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:34,000
Complain about someone fighting dirty in a real battle and see if that keeps them from killing you.

215
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:36,000
You do take orders well, at least.

216
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:38,000
You didn't even hesitate to follow my command.

217
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:41,000
Hard to believe you're that disobedient girl.

218
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,000
Back off.

219
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,000
Well, look at that.

220
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:49,000
You'd be dead right now if your comrade hadn't stepped in.

221
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,000
What?

222
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,000
Why the long face?

223
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:55,000
You don't think it was a dirty move for me to attack from behind, do you?

224
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:56,000
Huh.

225
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:58,000
I take back what I was going to say.

226
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:01,000
You are indeed Gurren's subordinate.

227
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,000
We're done?

228
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:04,000
That was pretty fast.

229
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,000
Xinyan.

230
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:08,000
Aw, but I don't wanna.

231
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:10,000
This isn't my kind of thing.

232
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:12,000
I don't enjoy bullying the weak.

233
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:15,000
As an adoptive son, you will do as you're told.

234
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,000
Man.

235
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:18,000
Well, if I must, fine.

236
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,000
Stop fooling around!

237
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:21,000
Who are you calling weak?

238
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:23,000
Why you, silly boy?

239
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,000
Wanna try me?

240
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:27,000
Well, that is the order I'm supposed to follow.

241
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,000
Let's begin.

242
